DESCRIPTION:With their very first note\, Denmark’s Stundom captivates au
 diences with soaring melodies\, irresistible rhythms\, and a chemistry tha
 t has quickly made them rising stars on the European folk scene. Blending 
 the pulse of Scandinavian dance music with the elegance of chamber music a
 nd modern cinematic textures\, this virtuosic trio—featuring violin\, ci
 ttern\, and piano—creates a sound that is both deeply rooted and strikin
 gly fresh. “immediately cast a spell over me.”— Museek
