DESCRIPTION:Familiar with Bridge? Want to come meet new people who have a 
 shared love of the game? Come and join our group at the community center. 
 Please message the group leader first.Bridge Group #1 is on the 2nd and 4t
 h Monday from 12-3pm contact Pat Rhodespatcroomrhodes@gmail.comBridge Grou
 p #2 is on the 1st and 3rd Monday from 12-3pm contact Jeff Eichingerjeff.e
