UID:6474c0d52e5e0376a9a5a68f467631a5@littlejumbobar.com
DESCRIPTION:Andy and Zack Page have been finishing each other's musical se
 ntences since before either could drive. Born four minutes apart and raise
 d in a house where blues records\, old-time singing\, and hard rock all sh
 ared the same air\, the twins grew into a guitar and a bass that move like
  one nervous system\, Andy's lines and Zack's low end tracking each other 
 so closely the seam disappears. Under the Page Brothers name they lead a r
 otating cast through gypsy swing\, straight-ahead jazz\, fusion\, and\, wh
 en the mood turns\, something closer to the metal they never quite outgrew
 . Tonight the cast runs four deep\, and the two players rounding out the q
 uartet have each spent a lifetime making music that record stores never kn
 ew where to shelve.\n\nSteve Davidowski was the original keyboardist in th
 e Dix...
LOCATION:Little Jumbo: 241 Broadway St.\, Asheville\, NC 28801
URL:https://www.littlejumbobar.com/events/1818/the-page-brothers-quartet
