SUMMARY:AVL International Connections - October Mix & Mingle
DESCRIPTION:AVL International Connections\nFor our **October International
  Mix & Mingle** we will gather on the beautiful riverside deck @ New Belgi
 um Brewery (River Arts District)! If you are new\, there will be lots of f
 olks to welcome you!! If you haven't come for a few months\, come and meet
  some new folks!\n\nWeather permitting\, we will be outside on New Belgium
 ’s beautiful deck overlooking the river. If it is chilly or raining\, we
 ’ll move inside to the taproom. Look for the Meetup signs and the AVL In
 ternational Connections' name tags. Grab a cold beverage and then join us!
 \n\nA local Food Truck will also be out front if anyone wants a bite to ea
 t!\n\nAs a growing group (over **1600** members)\, if you have friends tha
 t you would like to bring along\, please do! Also encourage them to sign u
 p on Meetup!
