 luding Sierra Fiddle Camp\, Folk College\, Boston States Fiddle Camp\, Han
 neke Cassel’s Pure Dead Fiddle Weekend\, Jink & Diddle School of Scottis
 h Fiddling\, the Heartbeat Music Project\, and Up With Music’s Summer St
