DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261025T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261025T123000
SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Kristikka
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, October 25th\n1st Danc
 e Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance 
 Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilitat
 or Kristikka (Kris Hostikka)\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About Kristikka\n\nKr
 istikka loves creating a sacred container that takes you on an inward jour
 ney utilizing rhythm to move us from quiet embodiment to chaos and down in
 to stillness and integration. She feels that movement is medicine\, weavin
 g intention and a rich blend of world beats where it’s possible to be wi
 th what is and open to what wants to be seen\, felt and moved. You can fin
 d her dance mixes here:[ ](http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka) [http://sou
 ndcloud.com/dj-kristikka](http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka)\n\\~\\~\\~\n
 \n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close pro
 mptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please
  be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: 
 $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPr
 e-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer
  and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovement
 collective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunte
 er/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkE
 DIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3EL
 hDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoo
 r will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY
  AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashe
 villemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollectiv
 e.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNy
 dGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLw
 gnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAshevi
 lle Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all 
 are free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our missi
 on and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-
 form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transformatio
 n. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, As
 heville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/316746907/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260928T105816Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260928T105816Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
