 King Tuff\, and Wavves. They’re joined by Asheville punk band **Designer
 **\, whose 2026 debut album Headcase moves between fast-paced rock & roll\
 , hardcore\, new wave\, and heavier melodic guitar work. *More about Jacuz
 zi Boys 
