 kyland / South Buncombe<br>Link: https://www.buncombecounty.org/governin
 g/depts/library/branch-locations/skyland-south-buncombe.aspx<br><br>Brin
 g your needles or your hooks and join us for some friendly company as yo
 u work on your current project.&#160\; No registration necessary\; just 
 come by the Skyland Library community room with a love of yarn!<br> <br>
  Please note this is not a class -- we welcome knitters and crocheters o
 f all skill levels\, but there might not be anyone on hand to teach the 
 basics if you&#39\;ve never tried before.&#160\; Feel free to come and c
 hat or observe\, though!
