UID:tribe-10005382@weavervillenc.org
DESCRIPTION:Sassy\, Classy & Full of Zumba Sass!Who says fun stops at 60? 
 Not on our watch!Zumba Gold – the groove that moves you!Designed for act
 ive older adults (and young-at-heart dancers)\, this FREE weekly class is 
 the perfect blend of low-impact moves and high-energy fun.Weaverville Comm
 unity CenterEvery Tuesday @ 6PMNo pressure\, no judgment—just joyful mov
 ement\, great music\, and good vibes.Grab your sneakers\, bring a friend\,
  and let’s boogie like it’s 1979 (with better knees).It’s exercise\,
  but it feel
